text(title, &quot;WASD · Shift sprint · Space jump · V camera\nHold E, click, touch or controller X near an object.\nRead the hallway invitation, then inspect the maintenance hatch.&quot;, UDim2.fromScale(0.1, 0.83), UDim2.fromScale(0.8, 0.14), 14)
